```java
public class VideoFrameSender {
    private VideoCapture capture;
    private Mat frame;

    public VideoFrameSender() {
        capture = new VideoCapture(0); // 0表示默认摄像头
        if (!capture.isOpened()) {
            System.out.println("Failed to open camera");
            return;
        }
    }

    public Mat nextFrame() {
        capture.read(frame);
        if (frame.empty()) {
            System.out.println("Failed to retrieve frame");
            return null;
        }
        return frame;
    }

    public void release() {
        capture.release();
    }
}
```

### 步骤 3: 实现Socket发送

创建一个类来处理Socket通信，将视频帧转换为字节数组并发送。

```java
public class SocketSender {
    private Socket socket;

    public SocketSender(String host, int port) throws IOException {
        socket = new Socket(host, port);
    }

    public void sendFrame(Mat frame) throws IOException {
        ByteArrayOutputStream bos = new ByteArrayOutputStream();
        Imgcodecs.imencode(".jpg", frame, bos);
        byte[] imageData = bos.toByteArray();

        ByteBuffer buffer = ByteBuffer.allocate(imageData.length);
        buffer.put(imageData);
        buffer.flip();

        socket.getOutputStream().write(buffer.array());
        socket.getOutputStream().flush();
    }

    public void close() throws IOException {
        socket.close();
    }
}
```

### 步骤 4: 主程序

在主程序中，创建视频帧获取器和Socket发送器，并实现发送循环。

```java
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        String host = "127.0.0.1"; // 接收方的IP地址
        int port = 12345; // 接收方的端口号

        VideoFrameSender sender = new VideoFrameSender();
        SocketSender socketSender = null;

        try {
            socketSender = new SocketSender(host, port);

            while (true) {
                Mat frame = sender.nextFrame();
                if (frame != null) {
                    socketSender.sendFrame(frame);
                }
            }
        } catch (IOException e) {
            e.printStackTrace();
        } finally {
            sender.release();
            if (socketSender != null) {
                try {
                    socketSender.close();
                } catch (IOException e) {
                    e.printStackTrace();
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
```

